Package: simttepower
Title: Power and Operating-Characteristic Analysis for PK/PD Time-to-Event
    Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carlos", "Traynor", , "carlos.traynor.qcp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A companion to 'simtte', providing trial replication and
    simulation-based power and operating-characteristic analysis on top
    of its single-cohort PK/PD time-to-event simulator. Given a trial
    design (arms, a 'simtte' model, sample size, follow-up) and a grid
    of scenarios that vary one or more factors -- a model parameter, a
    formula coefficient, a dosing regimen, a sampling schedule, sample
    size, follow-up, or covariate distribution -- 'simttepower'
    replicates each scenario, applies one or more user-pluggable or
    built-in analysis functions to each simulated trial, and summarises
    operating characteristics such as power and type I error across the
    grid, sequentially, across local worker processes, or split into
    independent chunks for a job scheduler.
